    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "59a3889bd9eba100763a0f53",
      "background": "",
      "content": "<p>Thanks for coming and<br/>\nyou made it<br/>\nYou made to the Volvelle Social Club<br/>\nIt’s our annual meeting<br/>\nand thanks for coming\n</p>\n<p>We are moving devices yet <br/>\nclubs of five are outlawed.<br/>\nEveryone signs up in a round-robin<br/>\nand we can’t have a pentagram<br/>\nSo no clubs of five\n</p>\n<p>It’s hot today<br/>\nReally hot inside<br/>\nIt feels about 72 degrees<br/>\nNot very good weather<br/>\nfor an annual meeting.\n</p>\n<p>But let’s press on<br/>\nThe heat of our bodies<br/>\nhas made things worse <br/>\n(The heat) Let’s start.<br/>\nAdd a disc to the Volvelle.\n</p>\n<p>An ionic column and<br/>\nour volunteers and <br/>\npartners are energetic. You <br/>\nlook so well I hardly believe it<br/>\nLike an ionic column\n</p>\n<p>Dearest members note<br/>\nwe begin the program<br/>\n<aa href=\"94,83\">very energetically</aa>.<br/>\nYou can change your mind<br/>\nIf you want you can\n</p>\n<p>When the fifth person joins<br/>\nYou go into hibernation.<br/>\nIt’s imperative that<br/>\nyou sleep until the next<br/>\nInterested person is found.\n</p>\n<p>At first this was painful<br/>\nBut it’s adventure really<br/>\nAll five of you there and<br/>\na sleeping adventure<br/>\nand not Convening\n</p>\n<p>You will be fine but<br/>\nthings don’t look good though.<br/>\nIt’s sort-of stuck between two.<br/>\nJust rattle the pin and<br/>\nAdd a disc to the Volvelle please\n</p>",
      "created": "2017-08-28T03:06:03.816Z",
      "fullWidth": false,
      "lovers": [
        "59a3898ed9eba100763a0f5a"
      ],
      "page": 48,
      "parent": {
        "__v": 0,
        "_id": "59a38775d9eba100763a0f4b",
        "background": "#feecd8",
        "content": "<lightimg bg=\"#feecd8\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/BmBJHp8.jpg\" width=\n\"1080\" height=\"1080\"></lightimg>\n\n<div class=\"indents\">\n<p>A new format of love is the bringing-over of a grey t-shirt to be stashed in the other’s place. The generation that this applies to don’t so much agree to the particular supplier and instance of shirt as much have it decided for them through convention and availability. Most poisons are produced for a particular use. When you wear the grey t-shirt, you look like an ionic column. But you shouldn't wear the shirt; that would reduce the situation unbearably; that would suck out the idea. Instead rest something unbending on the shirt while you’re cleaning up — other shirts, say, or a phone.</p>\n<p>Having the t-shirt stashed promises you an internal market. It sits off just to the side and people do things to it, which creates a form to make sense of the varieties of encounter that relate to you. Keep it by your bedside. You can think about it at work.</p>\n</div>",
        "created": "2017-08-28T03:01:09.985Z",
        "fullWidth": false,
